{"name":"Hearty Harandar Celebration","quality":4,"icon":"inv_misc_1h_soup_b_01_misc_1h_soup_b_01","tooltip":"<table><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q4\">Hearty Harandar Celebration</b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><br /><span style=\"color: #40C040\">Vegetarian</span><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->90</span><!--bo--><br><span class=\"q7\">Binds to Warband</span><!--ue--><!--ue--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></table><table><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"/spell=1278929/hearty-harandar-celebration\" class=\"q2\">Place a <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Hearty Harandar Celebration</span> for all players to enjoy!<br /><br /><a href=\"/spell=1232065/food-amp;-drink\" target=\"_blank\">Restores 7% of your maximum health and mana every second over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating.</a><br /><br /><span class=\"tooltip-inside-icon\" style=\"background-image: url(//wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/spell_misc_food.jpg)\"></span> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Hearty Well Fed</span><br />If you spend at least 10 seconds eating, you will become <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Hearty Well Fed</span> gaining <!--pts7:0:0:1219179-->98<!----> Stamina and <!--pts2:0:0:1219179-->50<!----> primary stat for 1 hour.<br /><br />This effect persists through death.<!--?266996:1:90:90:15249:0:0:90--></a><!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br>Requires Level <!--rlvl-->90<br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--><div class=\"whtt-extra whtt-maxstack\">Max Stack: 1000</div><div class=\"whtt-sellprice\">Sell Price: <span class=\"moneysilver\">33</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">50</span></div></td></tr></table>","spells":[]}